# Nephio Network Slicing Testbed

Multi-cluster Nephio lab for 5G network slicing with GitOps (Config Sync + Gitea).

## Clusters

| Cluster | Context | Kubeconfig | Control plane |
|---------|---------|------------|---------------|
| mgmt | `mgmt@mgmt` | `~/.kube/config` | mgmt-0 (10.1.132.200) |
| central | `central@central` | `~/.kube/config-central` | central-0 |
| regional | `regional@regional` | `~/.kube/config-regional` | regional-0 |
| edge | `edge@edge` | `~/.kube/config-edge` | edge-0 |
| ue | `ue@ue` | `~/.kube/config-ue` | ue-0 |

Combine kubeconfigs: `export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/config:~/.kube/config-central:...`

IP addresses, VIPs, and pools live in `scripts/cluster_lib.sh` and `nephio/docs/ip.md`. SSH aliases: `utils/ssh_config/config`.

## Repo layout

- `bringup/` — staged install: Gitea (`01_gitea`), Config Sync (`02_configsync`), git push (`03_push_to_git_repos`); Nephio packages under `bringup/nephio/`
- `nephio/docs/` — K8s / Nephio platform docs (testbed, IPs, Config Sync, Gitea)
- `docs/` — OAI / network-slicing docs (`oai.md`, `oai-deployment.md`)
- `repos/` — GitOps source of truth per cluster (`mgmt`, `central-repo`, `regional-repo`, `edge-repo`, `ue-repo`)
- `scripts/` — render GitOps manifests, cluster bringup, diagnostics (`check-configsync.sh`, `bringup_cluster.sh`)
- `utils/` — netplan, registry, SSH config

## GitOps workflow

1. Render manifests: `./scripts/render_*_gitops.sh` (order matters — see `nephio/docs/config_sync.md`)
2. Push to Gitea: `./bringup/03_push_to_git_repos/push_git_repos.sh`
3. Verify: `./scripts/check-configsync.sh`

OAI: core on **central**, CU-CP on **edge**, CU-UPs on **regional**, DU/UEs on **edge `usrp`**. Macvlan on `10.1.139.0/24`.

## Conventions

- Bash scripts: `set -euo pipefail`, source `scripts/cluster_lib.sh` for cluster/IP helpers
- Gitea creds (lab): `nephio` / `secret` at `http://10.1.132.200:3000`
- Minimize scope; match existing script style; do not commit unless asked
- Primary docs: `readme.md`, `nephio/docs/testbed.md`, `nephio/docs/config_sync.md`
